# GitHub Copilot MCP note (blueprint)

Copilot has no repo-level MCP config surface blueprint can generate
(VS Code reads editor-level `.vscode/mcp.json`; other Copilot surfaces
configure MCP outside the repository), so no config file is emitted.

Servers declared in .blueprint/config.toml, for manual wiring wherever
this tool actually reads MCP config:

- `blueprint`: `blueprint mcp serve`
